    "lawCode": "Amd §1, Chap 53 of 2021",
    "lawSection": "Social Services",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S7188\n\nSPONSOR: KRUEGER\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 53 of the laws of 2021, enacting the aid to\nlocalities budget, in relation to funding for the child care facilitated\nenrollment program\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nTo correct an error in the State Fiscal Year 2021-2022 Enacted Budget.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 of the bill amends the Department of Family Assistance Office\nof Children and Family Services Budget\n\nSection 2 provides that the act shall take effect immediately and be\ndeemed to have been in full force and effect on and after April 1, 2021.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThe State Fiscal Year 2021-2022 Enacted Budget names the wrong entities\nto implement the facilitated enrollment program in Erie and Onondaga\nCounties. This bill names the correct entities.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNone.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS FOR STATE AND LOCAL GOVERNMENTS:\n\nNone.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediately and be deemed to have been in full force and effect on and\nafter April 1, 2021.\n",
